{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learning Doesn't Need to Be Loud.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing <strong>Back 2 Basic</strong>, an early education game designed with a simple truth: <strong>learning happens in a calm, focused environment.</strong> Genuine education doesn't require flashy distractions or constant over-stimulation. Instead, I've designed a <strong>low-stimulus and special needs friendly</strong> experience that puts learning first. <strong>Back 2 Basic</strong> offers a refreshing alternative, putting the focus squarely on learning for Pre-K to 1st graders, removing the distracting clutter to provide a thoughtfully designed tool to aid parents and teachers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Young learners have short attention spans. That's why <strong>Back 2 Basic</strong> is designed for effective learning in under 20 minutes. Each lesson visually centers your child's focus, creating a nurturing environment free from unnecessary distractions. Gain insight into their progress with digestible player statistics, empowering you to make informed decisions about their learning journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/b8d5d674bfaaee2d8aaa913d1f39698f.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=230 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/4d6c87804a150ffc88e4ff10d1687b0b.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=230 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foundational Curriculum:</strong> Lessons cover <strong>early math (addition, subtraction, counting, quantity, currency)</strong>, <strong>telling time</strong>, <strong>basic shapes</strong>, <strong>color recognition and mixing</strong>, alongside sequencing, multi-step instructions, memory, and letter/number/sight word recognition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purposefully Low-Stimulus Design:</strong> Crafted with softened colors, gentle animations, and minimal sound cues to create a calm and focused learning environment, particularly beneficial for neurodivergent children and those prone to over-stimulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unparalleled Parental Customization:</strong> Empowering tools let you tailor every aspect of the learning journey, including adding personalized spelling lists and recording your own voice instructions for a truly bespoke experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely Ad-Free &amp; Microtransaction-Free:</strong> No hidden costs, in-app purchases, or nasty monetization strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actionable Insights:</strong> Digestible player statistics offer parents and educators a genuine understanding of a child's learning patterns, strengths, and areas for growth, supporting informed educational decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful Behavioral Support:</strong> Incorporates subtle design mechanics aimed at reducing potential self-stimulatory behaviors, fostering a more productive learning experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Developer Collaboration:</strong> An open channel for community feedback, inviting suggestions for new lessons or features, and ensuring the game evolves directly with the needs of the community.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lessons and Activities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/4fa75cec65ce8104c3b95af3a2bb5322.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/51554e3727476ed71d28e283222daa60.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/3db3fecf3c05c6b4efb7bc30b822e1c3.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/20ab9ac5a4c5d03a22f8afe556080d53.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/e382f2c960a5d12b897771f19795e2f2.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/65d33e3b293535427bc0fbdd6c0736ed.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/c55a71ad913882c90589577e0b9d8c97.avif?t=1771614546\" width=384 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/758472331e7110d26f3b0eedc17b2cbe.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/66a36c7cfe8d23be2f2cdd20b027f1dc.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=1