ions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful Behavioral Support:</strong> Incorporates subtle design mechanics aimed at reducing potential self-stimulatory behaviors, fostering a more productive learning experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Developer Collaboration:</strong> An open channel for community feedback, inviting suggestions for new lessons or features, and ensuring the game evolves directly with the needs of the community.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lessons and Activities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/4fa75cec65ce8104c3b95af3a2bb5322.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/51554e3727476ed71d28e283222daa60.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/3db3fecf3c05c6b4efb7bc30b822e1c3.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/20ab9ac5a4c5d03a22f8afe556080d53.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extras/e382f2c960a5d12b897771f19795e2f2.avif?t=1771614546\" width=128 height=178 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611630/extra